    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## RAG phase 1: ingest\n\n1. Copy `week2/Products.xlsx` into Google Sheets.\n2. Put that spreadsheet ID in **Get products from Google Sheets** (or reselect it from the dropdown).\n3. Run the SQL from `res.pdf` in Supabase so `knowledgebase` exists.\n4. Create a **Supabase** credential in n8n. Use the project URL **without** `/rest/v1`.\n5. Execute. The loader turns each row into a document, embeddings vectorize it, and the vector store inserts it.\n\n`dataField` / JSON pointers: if your rows have a `description` column, set **Options -> JSON Pointers** to `/description` on the loader for cleaner chunks.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 600
      },
